title: The Banners Is Banned!
subtitle: Our so-called "revolutionary militia" is now officially outlawed nationwide.
view-if: chancellor == "Staal" and (dsu_in_gov or dsu_was_gov) and dsu_policy and ((reichstag_joever_time >= 8 and not staal_post_protests) or (reichstag_joever_time >= 18 and staal_post_protests)) and banner_force < 20 and (state_force + far_right_force) >= 80 and not staal_pause and (heartland_leader == "Crowde" or heartland_leader == "Goodlake")
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
priority: -1
tags: event
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/reichsbanner_march.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= The Banners Banned

Following months of state repression, the hollowed-out remnants of the Banners are officially banned. With the more moderate fighters having retired or been absorbed into the state’s militias, only die-hard <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformists</span> remain in the self-defense organization. This has given Staal the pretext to brand the <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span> and the Banners as jointly conspiring toward revolutionary overthrow—and to extend the ban to both. With it, the last armed body in the Commonwealth not answerable to the state is gone, and Staal's monopoly on force—the bedrock of the order he means to build—is very nearly complete.

If this ban goes through, we will be left defenseless against state oppression. Many in the party urge us to resist, while others claim that the era of paramilitaries is over and argue for preemptive disarmament to placate Staal.

- @fight
- @rb_explode

@fight
title: Fight!

Are you sure? Staal is only moving against the Banners because he feels confident now that it’s weak. He may be eagerly awaiting a pretext to strike at the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> itself. The full force of the state is more than we can resist.

You should reconsider.

- @civil_war: We'll go out with a bang!
- @rb_explode

@rb_explode
title: Disband the Banners.
subtitle: +2 resources
on-arrival: {!
Q.banner_explode = 1;
Q.pro_republic -= 5;

Q.resources += 2;

Q.banner_strength = 0;
Q.banner_militancy = 0;

Q.staal_marcher_influence += 2;
Q.staal_marcher_r += 1;
Q.staal_marcher_support -= 2;

Q.commons_marcher -= 2;
Q.disfavored_marcher -= 4;

Q.commons_gnu += 2;
Q.disfavored_gnu += 4;

Q.unionist_relation -= 5;
Q.ddp_relation -= 5;
Q.lvp_relation -= 5;
!}

We have decided to cooperate with the government by preemptively dissolving the organization and turning over weapons before the ban is to take place. A notable amount of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformists</span> have decided to fight on however, but without numbers or weapons, this ad-hoc group is destined for failure. 

Staal hasn't expressed the gratitude for our cooperation like we hoped. Perhaps we outlived our usefulness to him.